hpc:JobInfo a owl:Class .
hpc:JobDescMsg a owl:Class .
hpc:JobPostResponse a owl:Class .

hpc:jobId rdf:type owl:DatatypeProperty ;
    rdfs:domain hpc:JobInfo ;
    rdfs:range xsd:string .

hpc:jobDesc rdf:type owl:ObjectProperty ;
    rdfs:domain hpc:JobPostResponse ;
    rdfs:range hpc:JobDescMsg .
```

This ontology fragment represents three classes: `JobInfo`, `JobDescMsg`, and `JobPostResponse`. It also defines a datatype property `jobId` for `JobInfo` and an object property `jobDesc` for `JobPostResponse`. The `jobId` property is expected to have a string value, and the `jobDesc` property is expected to have an instance of `JobDescMsg` as its value.
